      en: ["Ivory Coast produces over 1 million tonnes of natural rubber per year.", "TRCI is among the pioneers of rubber processing in the country.", "The Bongo plant processes hundreds of tonnes of latex daily.", "The tire industry is the main buyer of TRCI products.", "Rubber trees can be tapped for over 25 years.", "The company supports reforestation projects in the region."]
